  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Adsorption of a gas follows Freundlich adsorption isotherm. In the given plot, <math><mi>x</mi></math> is the mass of the gas adsorbed on mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> of the adsorbent at pressure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></math> is proportional to:<br /><br /><img height=\"153\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/78be4be2-6173-43b4-9a70-1676bc73e7c5-image.png\" width=\"247\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
